  question: What does it mean to confess Jesus as Lord?
  answers:
  - Go to church
  - To inwardly and outwardly proclaim Him as God
  - Give lots of money
  - To be silent about Jesus
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: Confessing Jesus as Lord is an outward profession of and inward
    belief that Jesus is God and has ownership of your life.
